        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I verify the reliability of Packers And Movers In Kuching for a long‑distance move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Check for ISO 9001:2015 certification, IBA mover code approval, and a minimum 4.5‑star rating on Google. Request the company’s GST invoice template, insurance policy copy, and GPS tracking credentials. A reputable mover will provide transparent cost breakdowns, vehicle registration numbers, and references from recent 850 km relocations.</p>
