        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do Packers And Movers In Kuching issue GST‑compliant invoices for corporate reimbursement?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All moves are billed with a GST‑registered invoice that details service description, GSTIN, HSN code, and itemized charges. The invoice is accepted by central and state government departments, PSUs, and private corporations for reimbursement claims, ensuring full tax compliance.</p>
