      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is my household goods insured during the 850 km transit from Kuching?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers provides 100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance approved by IRDAI. The policy covers loss, theft, or damage from loading to unloading. Clients receive a certificate of insurance before dispatch, and any claim is settled within 7‑10 business days.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What packing materials are used for delicate items like glassware and electronics?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system employs 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, double‑wall corrugated sheets, stretch film, and custom‑cut wooden crates. Each fragile item is wrapped individually, cushioned, and placed in sealed crates to prevent vibration and moisture damage during the Kuching‑to‑hub journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time while it moves from Kuching to the destination?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every truck is equipped with satellite GPS that streams live location to a client portal. Customers receive a tracking link via SMS or email, allowing them to monitor progress, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations instantly.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for moving household goods across state lines from Kuching?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You need a valid ID proof, address proof at both origin and destination, a signed moving contract, GST invoice, e‑Way bill for goods above the taxable limit, and a copy of the insurance policy. For corporate moves, include the company’s PAN and authorization letter.</p>
